WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.977
You log in.
Your password never reaches your agent.

00:00:03.977 --> 00:00:04.400
You: The API on staging is down. Look at my Conn terminal and get it running again.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.096
It wants to delete the whole cache.

00:00:07.096 --> 00:00:08.416
You say no.

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:11.286
Then you just type.
Your keystroke takes the terminal back.

00:00:11.716 --> 00:00:14.916
Your agent works in your terminal. You keep the keyboard.
Real Conn, a real SSH login and a real Claude Code session in one continuous take. Prepared scenario; still moments shortened.
